-----------------------------------------------------------------------
THIS SOFTWARE IS NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

It is a teaching tool. Nothing it produces is a clinical finding, a
prediction of drug activity, or evidence of safety or efficacy in any
patient. Every result is a computational estimate and the software
says so at each step. It must not be used to make any decision about
the care of any person.


-----------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE INCLUDED IN THE INSTALLER
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

This software orchestrates established tools; it does not reimplement
them. The installer carries the following, each under its own licence,
and each is named and cited in the record of every run.

  AutoDock Vina      Apache-2.0
                     Eberhardt J, Santos-Martins D, Tillack AF,
                     Forli S. AutoDock Vina 1.2.0. J Chem Inf Model.
                     2021;61(8):3891-3898.

  RDKit              BSD-3-Clause
                     Landrum G et al. RDKit: Open-source
                     cheminformatics.

  OpenMM             MIT and LGPL-3.0
                     Eastman P et al. OpenMM 7. PLoS Comput Biol.
                     2017;13(7):e1005659.

  PDBFixer           MIT

  Meeko              LGPL-2.1
                     Forli Lab, Scripps Research.

  NumPy              BSD-3-Clause
  SciPy              BSD-3-Clause
  NiceGUI            MIT
  PyYAML             MIT

The LGPL components are included unmodified and are dynamically
linked. Their source is available from conda-forge.


